{% comment %}
  This assumes that products are unique within the current section
  Several blocks (add buttons, quantity, subscription) each compute this id on
  their own and rely on getting the same value, since their inputs join the
  form through the form="" attribute. That is why the id can only use shared
  context: one product form per product per section. A second "Form buttons"
  block for the same product in one section duplicates the form id and leaves
  quantity/subscription inputs ambiguously bound — unsupported.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign product_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: product.handle | append: '-' | append: section.id %}